/T (The spatial data product allows users to query any part of the state-wide map, by simply entering a street address, to view suitability class, soil, climate and terrain parameters and information on vulnerabilities or risks \(8\). Market tools, financial modules, irrigation case studies and fact sheets also exist alongside the map products to inform management requirements for an enterprise to become profitable \(6,8\). )
