/S /H1
/T (These climatic conditions can have a significant impact on disease, pests, vine health and ripening times. Ripeness also impacts the sugar content, colour, flavour and alcohol content of a wine \(16,17\). On top of this, changes in harvest times are increasing logistical challenges and putting pressure on the infrastructure required for harvest, as well as winery processing equipment and tank space. Fruit pickers and other workers face additional occupational health and safety concerns from working in extreme heat conditions \(16,17\). )
/E (These climatic conditions can have a significant impact on disease, pests, vine health and ripening times. Ripeness also impacts the sugar content, colour, flavour and alcohol content of a wine \(16,17\). On top of this, changes in harvest times are increasing logistical challenges and putting pressure on the infrastructure required for harvest, as well as winery processing equipment and tank space. Fruit pickers and other workers face additional occupational health and safety concerns from working in extreme heat conditions \(16,17\). )
/Alt ()
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [12]
>>
