/S /P
/E (Agricultural consultants are regularly contracted to identify and develop suitable land, inform new investments and conduct due-diligence checks. These consultants have used the maps as an initial guide to inform further analysis:  )
/Alt ()
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [4]
>>
