501 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The information contained in the ESM can be used to recommend choice of vine species, design of a vineyard, or other risk management \(adaptation\) strategies that might need to be planned for. Consultants highlight that the frost risk maps, and growing degree day maps are the most important products because they address the two most significant climate risks for growers in Tasmania and this information is not available elsewhere:   )
/Alt ()
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
