/S /P
/E (Anecdotal evidence from interviewees suggested some cases where the maps have also been used for conservation purposes and by Natural Resource Management \(NRM\) groups, including using the versatility index maps to inform suitable land use planning and identify suitable conservation areas.  )
/Alt ()
/Pg 25 0 R
/K [11]
>>
