622 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This case study sought to understand how an information product like the ESM can enable climate change adaptation to occur. We explored if and how information results in practical on-ground actions that reduce vulnerability to climate risks. It quickly became apparent that the ESM product was part of a much larger piece of work from the Tasmanian Government.  )
/Alt ()
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
