626 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (This policy was also extremely well timed in that it aligned with increasing attention from interstate wine makers like Brown Family Wine Group who suffered due to the Millennium Drought. This opportunity was recognised in early reports from the Tasmanian Government, though it is difficult to attribute timing which could also have been a matter of good fortune.  )
/Alt ()
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
