649 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (This case study provides valuable empirical evidence to demonstrate how enabling adaptation can take shape in complex realities, and how complex enabling environments can be. Among these complexities arise three main lessons from this work.    )
/E (This case study provides valuable empirical evidence to demonstrate how enabling adaptation can take shape in complex realities, and how complex enabling environments can be. Among these complexities arise three main lessons from this work.    )
/Alt ()
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
650 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (First, this case study highlights the importance of quality government policies with substantial, ongoing investment and coordinated, well-backed strategies in seeing through substantive change. Continuity in investment to this degree is rare.    )
/E (First, this case study highlights the importance of quality government policies with substantial, ongoing investment and coordinated, well-backed strategies in seeing through substantive change. Continuity in investment to this degree is rare.    )
/Alt ()
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
651 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Second, this case study suggests that while climate information is extremely important in enabling quality adaptation decisions, it is not a catalyst for change and must be well-timed and well supported by other enabling factors.    )
/E (Second, this case study suggests that while climate information is extremely important in enabling quality adaptation decisions, it is not a catalyst for change and must be well-timed and well supported by other enabling factors.    )
/Alt ()
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
652 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Finally, we reiterate the necessity of quality participation and how integral this can be to adaptation outcomes, leading usable information products that fulfil the needs of stakeholders.   )
/E (Finally, we reiterate the necessity of quality participation and how integral this can be to adaptation outcomes, leading usable information products that fulfil the needs of stakeholders.   )
/Alt ()
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [4]
>>
